'''9.''' An establishment for manufacturing, or for performing industrial labor of any sort: generally in the plural, including all the buildings, machines, etc., used in the required operations: as, iron-''works''; hence the plural is used as a collective singular, taking then a singular article: as, there is ''a'' large glass-''works'' in the town.

